          "type": "rich-text",
          "settings": {
            "rich_text": "<h4><strong>Beauty, With Intention</strong></h4><p><strong>LINDÍSIMA is a women-owned clean beauty brand based in New York, founded by Colombian entrepreneurs Victoria Beltran and Linda Soares.</strong></p><p></p><p>Inspired by their roots and a deep connection to nature, LINDÍSIMA creates <strong>clean, vegan, cruelty-free, plant-based skincare</strong> designed to support both skin health and mindful self-care.</p><p></p><p>At LINDÍSIMA, beauty is approached as a <strong>daily ritual of care rather than perfection</strong>, encouraging presence, balance, and natural glow.</p><p></p><h3>Our Roots</h3><p>LINDÍSIMA was created to honor a connection to nature, culture, and the quiet rituals that shape everyday life. Inspired by Colombia’s landscapes and now based in New York, the brand reflects a meeting of heritage and modern living.</p><p>The <strong>Cattleya orchid</strong>, Colombia’s national flower, became our symbol — representing beauty, renewal, and resilience. Like the flower itself, beauty unfolds gently through care, patience, and intention.</p><h3>Our Philosophy</h3><p>LINDÍSIMA exists at the intersection of <strong>clean beauty and everyday wellness</strong>. Each product is thoughtfully formulated to support the skin while creating moments of connection and self-care.</p><p>Our approach is guided by three principles:</p><p><strong>Botanical Integrity:</strong>Plant-based formulations inspired by nature and guided by purity and transparency.</p><p><strong>Ritual & Intimacy:</strong>Skincare experienced as a personal ritual that encourages presence and well-being.</p><p><strong>Modern Femininity:</strong>Beauty that celebrates confidence, softness, and authenticity.</p><h3>Conscious Formulation</h3><p>Every LINDÍSIMA product is created with care, responsibility, and transparency.</p><p>Our formulations are:</p><p>• Vegan</p><p>• Cruelty-free</p><p>• Plant-based</p><p>• Clean and thoughtfully formulated</p><p>Each ingredient is selected with intention to support healthy skin and natural radiance.</p><p><strong>LINDÍSIMA</strong></p><p>Thoughtful. Intentional. Gently powerful.</p><p>Beauty is nurtured.<br/><br/></p>"
